# scenario: blocked-preflight
# doc: blocked-preflight.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude blocked-preflight.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: the start shell is not approved (no --yolo, no whitelist, no terminal), so the shell audit denies it during preflight
